## English summary (short)

The **event and match data** in `data/` is sourced from Tencent's public esports data endpoints. **Copyright in that data belongs to Tencent / the Honor of Kings esports organizers.** The maintainers of this repository do **not** claim copyright over the factual data and grant **no** rights beyond those permitted by the rights holders.

The **repository's own work** — file layout, field schema, scripts (`scripts/`), SQL (`sql/`), and documentation — is licensed under **CC BY-NC 4.0** (Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International), full text at <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/legalcode>. Attribution: link to <https://github.com/Fire-Phoenixs/kpl-bp-dataset> and to the underlying data source; indicate changes; **no commercial use**.

This project is **unofficial** and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Tencent, TiMi Studio Group, or the KPL. Provided "as is", without warranty of any kind.
